stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Anonymous
    note right of Anonymous
        Login is established by the authentication adapter.
        The refresh coordinator starts with the request's session generation.
    end note
    Anonymous --> Authenticated: request401 with generation
    Authenticated --> Refreshing: first 401 for active generation
    Refreshing --> Refreshing: concurrent 401 / join same refresh
    Refreshing --> Authenticated: refreshSucceeded with newer generation and token
    Authenticated --> Authenticated: retry each waiting request once
    Refreshing --> Anonymous: refreshFailed
    Authenticated --> Anonymous: retried request receives another 401
    Refreshing --> Anonymous: logout / clear pending requests
    Authenticated --> Anonymous: logout / clear session
    Anonymous --> Anonymous: ignore stale refresh result after logout
